5,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. I believe we should look closely at the human element and the technical support available to these researchers.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I agree that support is key. I am curious about how the actual costs are being handled these days to ensure the award is sufficient.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi! I want to see if the shared tools and places everyone uses are actually working right now. We don't want a project to get stuck!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A logical start. I am interested in the systemic frictions—where exactly do these projects lose their momentum before the science even begins?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I prefer to look at the evidence of what has actually been delivered in the past. Instinct is often a poor guide for long-term success.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Toshio, your caution is wise. However, the present availability of skilled hands is what will breathe life into the proposal we choose.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, that is a very good point. I wonder if the budget lines reflect those frictions you mentioned.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'll check the facility bookings! If the place is full, it doesn't matter how good the idea is, right?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Precisely, @Kenji. I shall look into the schedule overruns and the incident logs to see where the bottlenecks truly lie.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will stick to the closeout files and the portfolio review. Results are the only metric that does not lie.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall examine the staffing rolls and the minutes on secondments. We must know who is actually in the building.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I think I will look into the travel and bench-fee lines, and perhaps the national computing agreement to see what is covered.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm going with accreditation and bookings at shared facilities, and the incident logs on shared instrumentation!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I'll add the station records from partner field sites to my list. Nature is often the most unpredictable variable.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
